## Release decision

**Yes. Book 7 Movement 1 can be released for drafting after all amendments 1-16 are applied, including the authorized protected changes under OWNER #18 and #42 but excluding the still-protected OI-1/OI-2 wording.** The closed prose supplies every M1 entry fact: people, bodies, standings, fragments, anomaly, sealed/idle state, objects, letters, calendar and camp/fire order (B6 ch55:3-163; ch57:3-53; ch59:235-361; ch60:3-57, 117-225, 277-321).

Nothing needed for M1 must wait for the owner. **OI-1 must be resolved before Movement 4 (and its closing clause before Movement 8); OI-2 must be resolved before Movement 7.** The residual generic season/month wording found in closed Book 6 is a separate Book 6 cleanup under OWNER #42; it does not make the Book 7 handoff factually indeterminate (B6 ch53:251; ch59:195).

