    94	## 3. The expansion plan — where the extra ≈197,000 words come from
    95	
    96	Nothing below may change an end state, move a death, add an acquisition, or disclose a reserved truth early (§11). Every new episode must fit the sequence locks in §13. Word figures are planning estimates, not quotas.
    97	
