   352	### Coordinator rulings (binding)
   353	- **Deployment since the Line stays ONE.** No fragment was used on the mountain: Compression and Anchor wanted, and Cael held. Shadow sealed and unused. Lira's burst on day 78 is her own native Wind; her body went about twenty feet and her DECLARATION, with its crack, crossed the gorge.
   354	- **The herd's sense is DERIVED, not tested** (Karis: the ledge went and the declaration followed in the same breath — two causes in an accident, not one cause in a test). Derived on the 75th, used on the 78th. The animals are never given a Path. The herd's dead are "heard, not sworn"; twenty-five were counted on the 81st and the missing five are not entered as dead.
   355	- **Karis's lattice:** nine points and eight channels on the mountain, no join longer than eight paces (Drawn Channel's canon limit; a channel holds only while both points hold; her maximum is sixteen points). Her farthest point is not capped. It empties her.
   356	- **Oryn** is the first healer met past the Line. Tide as taught: contact only; about three serious mendings a day fed and slept, two on a road; cannot heal herself; "Because I cannot mend what I can't read."; the short reading (seconds) and the long one (both hands, all of her, minutes) — healing houses say surface and deep. The stall is named once. She knows NOTHING of fragments, has run no deep reading, records nothing and remembers. Her reading of Cael stopped at five; she said only "a river in the dark" and that it has no side she can find. "More than one" is NOT said (Movement 5).
