    43	- "Noted" order: Vastin's first is here. Teague does not say it yet.
    44	- The wall's count is the crew's six, Karis included, plus Teague's four. The healers are not on it.
    45	
    46	## What the author owns
    47	
    48	How the road east reads in reverse. The plank room's crowd. The meadow's details. Teague's crew at the table. How the grade's numbers come off the sheets. Millrace's lean-to, light and noise. How long the deep reading takes on the page.
    49	
    50	## Where we leave pressure
    51	
    52	Twelve walk east along a straightedge's line, two of them on no wall's count. A healer's route and a researcher's archive ride on one mule. A boy carries two findings that do not agree and a warning that has started to lean. Five days out is a fence the Compact built, and somebody is still watching it.
