   140	| **Lira** | To find out what she is without a ladder | Asks Oryn to mend the ankle (her first ask since Norhold). Fights on through the arm's first warning (M2), then listens at the second. Keeps her registry paper in her coat and goes up as a hand. Looks at the whole ladder and it does not pull. Holds her question at the court ("Well?") and accepts "on the road". | 12 |
