     2	
     3	- PWA book id: fractured-path/book-08-before-the-paths (Monroe 1.3 edition)
     4	- Series id: fractured-path
     5	- Author: Opus (Claude Opus 5.5)
     6	- Chapters: 1–6 (6 chapters) → `manuscript/chapter-01.md` … `chapter-06.md`
     7	- Word budget: ~30,000
     8	- Owner names: no new names. New figures stay named by role: the axe-head hold's factor, the carter on the ice, the ferryman.
